recall(own)  : RDT components with at least one prop declared in the project (the old metric).
recall(any)  : RDT components with any props at all, so components whose props live in uninstalled packages count too.
extras       : Caliper components with no RDT component of the same normalized name in the same file.
props(own)   : share of RDT's own-declared props that Caliper reports for matched components.

Usage: python3 score.py <binary> [label]
